 23    /** FUNCTION otap_string.cut
 24    * Basic string cutting to a given size. Does not trim the result.
 25    * Limited to PLSQL string size. On using defaults return a NULL string. Can be used in PLSQL to guarantee string
 26    * length for a used variable size and avoid exceptions on oversized strings.
 27    *
 28    * @param p_string The string to cut to the given size.
 29    * @param p_size The maximum length for the result string.
 30    *
 31    * @return The result string with the given size, probably cutted.
 32    */
 33    FUNCTION cut( p_string VARCHAR2 DEFAULT NULL
 34  		   , p_size   INTEGER  DEFAULT 0
 35  		   )
 36  	 RETURN VARCHAR2
 37    ;
