148    /** FUNCTION otap_test.set_test_name
149    * Handles and sets the current active test name. If test name is longer than 256 chars
150    * it is cutted to 256 chars. If NULL is given than, otap_constants.OTAP_FALLBACK_DEFAULT_TEST_NAME
151    * is used. Only valid within one session, if session ends, test name is reset.
152    * Wrapper for otap_api.otap_session_set_test_name.
153    *
154    * Test names are usually retrieved from the executed test function or procedure. Can
155    * be used to overwrite the group within a test function or procedure.
156    *
157    * @param p_test_name The test name to use for the next test.
158    *
159    * @return The test name currently active as text message.
160    */
161    FUNCTION set_test_name(p_test_name IN VARCHAR2)
162  	 RETURN VARCHAR2
