165    /** FUNCTION otap_test.set_test_group
166    * Handles and sets the current active test group. If test group name is longer than 256 chars
167    * it is cutted to 256 chars. If NULL is given than, otap_constants.OTAP_FALLBACK_DEFAULT_TEST_GROUP
168    * is used. Only valid within one session, if session ends, test name is reset.
